              "id": 5,
              "title": "4. Share, comment and collaborate!",
              "description": "## 🤝 How to collaborate in your board?\n\nShare your cards and boards with others. In many Nextcloud apps, linked Nextcloud Deck items will appear as rich, interactive widgets. Once you assign someone to a card, they will receive a notification.\n\nEdit cards together, leave notes for your teammates, share task-related files by adding attachments and discuss your tasks using card comments.\n\n### ",
